.TH ZIRO-DEFER 1 "2026-10-18" "ziro-defer 2.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ziro-defer \- multi-stage runtime task scheduler for Zsh
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ziro-defer
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ziro-defer
schedules shell tasks across 8 deterministic stages with 4 priority slots,
dependency graphs, conditional execution, and JSONL telemetry.
Hot-path stages (0-4) run with zero subprocess forks; cumulative budget is 4.6ms.
.PP
Legacy
.B zsh-defer
syntax is preserved as an alias that maps to
.B ziro-defer --stage=5 --slot=b
.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --stage=\fI0-7\fR
Execution stage (default: 5)
.TP
.B --slot=\fIa|b|c|d\fR
Priority slot (default: b)
.TP
.B --name=\fIid\fR
Unique task identifier for dependency tracking
.TP
.B --after=\fIid\fR
Hold execution until target task completes
.TP
.B --before=\fIid\fR
Block target task until this one completes
.TP
.B --depends=\fIids\fR
Space-separated list of task IDs this task depends on. Alias for
.BR --after ,
added in v2.0.0. Equivalent to
.BR --after=\fIids\fR .
.TP
.B --on-key=\fIkey\fR
Bind to a ZLE key (one-shot)
.TP
.B --if-var=\fIname\fR
Execute only if environment variable is set
.TP
.B --if-cmd=\fIname\fR
Execute only if command exists in PATH
.TP
.B --if-ssh
Execute only in SSH sessions
.TP
.B --if-not-root
Execute only if EUID != 0
.TP
.B --if-dir=\fIpath\fR
Execute only if directory exists
.TP
.B --timeout=\fIms\fR
Task timeout (default: 5000)
.TP
.B --measure
Force metrics recording
.TP
.B --quiet
Suppress diagnostic output
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.B ziro-defer-batch [OPTIONS] \fIplugins...\fR
Batch registration for multiple plugins
.TP
.B ziro-defer-dispatch [--force] \fI0-7\fR
Synchronously execute all queued tasks in a stage
.TP
.B ziro-defer-bind-widget \fIkey\fR \fIcmd\fR
Register a one-shot ZLE widget
.TP
.B ziro-defer-reorder --task=\fIid\fR --slot=\fIslot\fR
Change a pending task's priority slot
.TP
.B ziro-defer-stats [pattern]
Report aggregate metrics from metrics.jsonl
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/ziro/defer.conf
User configuration (TOML)
.TP
.I ~/.cache/ziro/defer/metrics.jsonl
JSONL metrics log
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zsh (1),
.BR zsh-defer (1)
.SH BUGS
Report bugs to https://github.com/Pakrohk/ziro-defer/issues
